    "cancellation": "Original native Request.signal supplied as private Context.Reference<Option<AbortSignal>>; synchronous native Effect callback registers then checks again and owns cleanup",
    "response": "Complete reply bytes bounded to 2 MiB and total handler/body read to ten seconds; no subscriptions or resumption advertised",
    "privacy": "Fixed declared failure vocabulary and existing safe error reporter; no raw causes, figures or rate identities in replies/logs"
