    "Expected input/capacity/timeout failures retain fixed safe tool codes; an internal defect returns the native fixed tool failure with positive fixed API reporting and no sentinel/pay figure.",
    "Exact 2 MiB framed response succeeds; one byte more fails, stalled body reaches the ten-second limit, and source streams close.",
